[ve:0.3.3]
[00:01.73]Little 
[00:02.46]purple rabbit.. 
[00:07.01]Smile 
[00:08.58]for 
[00:15.99]me.
[00:19.97]Oh oh oh
[00:22.65]Oh oh oh
[00:25.25]Aren’t you lovely?
[00:26.42]Aren’t you strange?
[00:27.64]Sugar teeth
[00:28.54]and cartoon rage.
[00:30.32]Paint that smile
[00:31.34]across your face.
[00:32.84]Make the terror
[00:33.85]look like grace.
[00:36.45]Laugh first.
[00:37.71]Bite first.
[00:39.01]Leave first.
[00:40.23]Never let them
[00:41.57]get inside.
[00:47.01]If they get close,
[00:49.73]hide the truth.
[00:52.54]Turn them small.
[00:55.10]Turn them sweet.
[00:57.74]Make them something
[01:00.26]you can smash.
[01:08.06]Isn’t she lovely?
[01:10.37]Isn’t she cruel?
[01:13.13]Purple rabbit,
[01:15.28]pretty little fool.
[01:18.32]Love is weakness.
[01:20.44]Need is evidence.
[01:23.49]Make them laugh
[01:25.40]before they leave you.
[01:28.64]Isn’t she lovely
[01:30.96]made of love?
[01:35.25]Or she's just terrified of it?
[01:38.78]Aren’t you pretty?
[01:39.96]Golden little lie.
[01:41.51]Joke before they hurt you.
[01:42.85]Smile before goodbye.
[01:44.30]Every hand becomes a threat.
[01:46.37]Every heart becomes a debt.
[01:49.04]If I push you out first,
[01:51.63]I never lost you yet.
[01:55.40]Laugh, laugh, laugh.
[01:57.23]Keep it light.
[02:00.36]Bite, bite, bite.
[02:02.27]Hold on tight.
[02:06.15]Love gets in.
[02:08.86]Lock the door.
[02:11.37]You’ve seen this trick
[02:13.88]before.
[02:17.69]LAUGH FIRST!
[02:18.58]BITE FIRST!
[02:19.75]LEAVE FIRST!
[02:21.33]MAKE THEM SMALL!
[02:22.54]MAKE THEM TOYS!
[02:24.01]LOVE BECAME A CRIME!
[02:28.18]Isn’t she lovely?
[02:30.23]Isn’t she wild?
[02:33.11]Little purple monster,
[02:35.56]terrified child.
[02:38.91]Laugh, laugh, laugh.
[02:41.15]Bite, bite, bite.
[02:44.32]Never let them
[02:47.40]get inside.
[03:02.78]Isn’t she lovely?
[03:05.41]Isn’t she cruel?
[03:08.22]Make them love you.
[03:10.62]Make them fools.
[03:13.15]Isn’t she lovely
[03:15.72]made of love?
[03:18.46]Or just afraid
[03:22.40]there won’t be enough?
[03:29.03]Isn’t she lovely…
[03:31.18]Isn’t she lonely…
[03:34.90]Laugh first.
[03:35.96]Bite first.
[03:37.26]Leave first.
[03:38.56]Never let them
